---
<Layout {...meta} mainClass="flex-1">
<nav aria-label="Migas de pan" class="border-b border-border/70 bg-secondary/40"><ol class="mx-auto flex max-w-[72rem] flex-wrap items-center gap-1 px-6 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/">Inicio</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3 shrink-0 opacity-60"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><a class="transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/diagnosticos">Diagnósticos</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3 shrink-0 opacity-60"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span aria-current="page" class="text-foreground/80">Diagnóstico IA 360</span></li></ol></nav><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[hsl(var(--ink))] text-white"><div aria-hidden="true" class="grid-lines absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.07]"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[72rem] px-6 py-16 sm:py-24"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary-foreground/70">Diagnóstico</p><h1 class="mt-4 max-w-[44rem] font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.9rem]">Diagnóstico IA 360</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-[44rem] text-base leading-relaxed text-white/70 sm:text-lg">Identificamos dónde la IA puede ahorrar tiempo o coste en tu empresa, y dónde no conviene.</p></div></section><section class="mx-auto grid max-w-[72rem] gap-12 px-6 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,26rem)] sm:py-20"><div><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Qué revisamos</h2><ul class="mt-6"><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Procesos candidatos y volumen real</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Estado y accesibilidad de los datos</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Herramientas actuales y riesgos de uso no gobernado</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 border-t border-border py-4 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-foreground/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Roadmap priorizado con estimación de impacto</span></li></ul><h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Cómo funciona</h2><ol class="mt-6"><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-t border-border py-5"><span class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">01</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Solicitud</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Rellenas el formulario con cinco datos básicos.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-t border-border py-5"><span class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">02</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Reunión inicial</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Videollamada de 30 minutos para acotar alcance y expectativas.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-t border-border py-5"><span class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">03</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Revisión</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Analizamos la información y los sistemas acordados.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-t border-border py-5"><span class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">04</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Informe</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Hallazgos priorizados, plan de acción y estimación de esfuerzo.</p></div></li></ol></div><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start"><h2 class="mb-5 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Diagnóstico IA 360: solicitud</h2><form novalidate="" class="border border-border bg-card p-6 sm:p-8" method="post" action="/api/contacto.php" data-cn-form="diagnostico-ia-360"><input type="hidden" name="form" value="diagnostico-ia-360"><input type="hidden" name="source_path" value=""><input type="hidden" name="ts" value=""><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 "><label for="diagnostico-ia-360-company" class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Nombre de la empresa</label><input id="diagnostico-ia-360-company" name="company" type="text" required="" maxlength="200" class="min-h-[46px] border border-input bg-background px-3 text-sm outline-none transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground/70 focus:border-primary"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 "><label for="diagnostico-ia-360-sector" class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Sector</label><input id="diagnostico-ia-360-sector" name="sector" type="text" required="" maxlength="200" class="min-h-[46px] border border-input bg-background px-3 text-sm outline-none transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground/70 focus:border-primary"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:col-span-2"><label for="diagnostico-ia-360-situation" class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Procesos a automatizar</label><textarea id="diagnostico-ia-360-situation" name="situation" rows="4" required="" maxlength="4000" class="border border-input bg-background p-3 text-sm outline-none transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground/70 focus:border-primary"></textarea></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 "><label for="diagnostico-ia-360-goal" class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Presupuesto estimado</label><input id="diagnostico-ia-360-goal" name="goal" type="text" maxlength="200" class="min-h-[46px] border border-input bg-background px-3 text-sm outline-none transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground/70 focus:border-primary"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:col-span-2"><label for="diagnostico-ia-360-contact" class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Email o teléfono</label><input id="diagnostico-ia-360-contact" name="contact" type="text" required="" maxlength="200" class="min-h-[46px] border border-input bg-background px-3 text-sm outline-none transition-colors placeholder:text-muted-foreground/70 focus:border-primary" placeholder="email@empresa.com o teléfono"></div></div><input type="text" name="company_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute h-0 w-0 opacity-0"><label class="mt-6 flex items-start gap-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required="" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 accent-[hsl(var(--primary))]"><span>Acepto el tratamiento de mis datos para atender esta solicitud, según la política de privacidad.</span></label><button type="submit" data-analytics="form-submit" class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-[48px] w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary px-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:bg-primary/90 active:scale-[0.98] disabled:opacity-70 sm:w-auto">Solicitar diagnóstico IA 360</button><p class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Datos tratados de forma confidencial. Sin spam comercial.</p><p data-cn-form-error class="mt-4 hidden text-sm text-destructive" role="alert"></p></form></div></section>
</Layout>
